@startuml collaboration-lifecycle-state
title WF-03 | Collaboration Lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam stateBackgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
top to bottom direction

state PLANNED
state IN_PROGRESS
state AWAITING_REVIEW
state COMPLETED
state CANCELLED
state TERMINATED

[*] --> PLANNED : / create when Deal is confirmed (BR-55)
PLANNED --> IN_PROGRESS : start\n[authorized Brand, current Deal revision, ACTIVE Campaign,\nconfirmed Deal, plan and assignment ready when COLLABORATIVE]\n/ start execution
PLANNED --> CANCELLED : cancel\n[current Deal revision and authorized Brand] / cancel before start
IN_PROGRESS --> AWAITING_REVIEW : accept\n[latest Outcome revision, complete results and costs,\nno pending termination request (BR-60/61)] / store acceptance
AWAITING_REVIEW --> IN_PROGRESS : reopen\n[current execution revision and reason] / mark acceptance reopened
AWAITING_REVIEW --> COMPLETED : review or completeWithoutReview\n[matching active acceptance and revision (BR-60/62)] / persist outcome and evidence
IN_PROGRESS --> TERMINATED : terminate\n[ACTIVE Campaign, current revision and pending request agreed by other party]\n/ record PORTAL termination
IN_PROGRESS --> TERMINATED : terminateExternal\n[ACTIVE Campaign, current revision, BRAND_MANAGED,\nowning Brand and valid consent record] / save BRAND_EXTERNAL termination
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
TERMINATED --> [*]

note right of IN_PROGRESS
  requestTermination(), decline and withdraw update
  the exit request. Collaboration stays IN_PROGRESS.
  Consent recorded outside Portal requires a non-future
  agreement time, reason and HTTPS evidence.
end note
@enduml
